# Runtime artifacts written by the local dev containers. api/.cache holds the
# precomputed pickle cache; api/infra/VERSION is an empty placeholder the dev
# container creates under the ./api bind mount. Neither belongs in git, and
# api/infra/VERSION in particular also clobbers the value baked into the
# production image (see api/Dockerfile).
api/.cache/
api/infra/
